  "name": "Cauliflower, Cheddar and Cannellini Bean Gratin with Sage Crumbs",
  "subtitle": "A creamy baked vegetable and bean main with a crisp lemon-sage topping.",
  "description": "Tender cauliflower and cannellini beans are coated in mustardy cheddar sauce, topped with mozzarella and seasoned crumbs, then baked until bubbling and golden.",
